            <ArticleTitle>[A mental health multidisciplinary team for pain and somatic care].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients suffering from mental illness or pervasive developmental disorders often resist examination and treatment. The Regional pain and somatic care in mental health centre of the Etampes public health institute (EPS) uses gas and air when carrying out nursing procedures. The nurses support patients with compassion, attentive to any nonverbal indication of pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
